  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets roughly doubled from ~600/month (Jun-Jul 2026) to ~1180-1260/month (Aug-Sep 2026, E-05) because the BV-17 billing-import validation rule deployed 2026-08-01 compares raw AMI register values against 12-month m3 consumption history with no unit scaling (E-13); since firmware v4.2 meters (rolled out June 2026) report registers in units of 0.1 m3 versus v3.x meters' m3 units (E-14), this mismatch causes billing import to reject legitimate high-consumption v4.2 reads and substitute estimates, producing wrong bills for 1184 of 1240 (95.5%) disputed ESTIMATED-read AMI-channel accounts (E-12)."
